The adapted text is in src/inspect_sentinel/_monitors/auto_mode_prompt.py,
in the sections whose comments say "adapted from Codex", and in two rules of
the "inspect" policy in src/inspect_sentinel/_monitors/auto_mode_policy.py,
named in its comments. Meridian Labs rewrote and shortened it for a judge of
agents under evaluation in a sandbox; the changes are Meridian Labs's, under
